Objective: 
Find password inside data.txt file. Password is next to the word millionth.

Commands used:
ls -a - lists all files inside the directory.
cat data.txt - echoes whatever is inside the file.
man grep - manual for grep
grep --help - the page that helps with examples and options.
grep -i "millionth" data.txt - Checks inside the file and finds the line that matches the command the user searched for.
                              -i ignores the "", used for words that have spaces.

